WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.550
Ryu starts Drive Impact after guarding Luke’s earlier jab.

2
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.100
Luke’s Drive Impact absorbs Ryu’s attack.

3
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.700
Luke’s counter Drive Impact connects as Punish Counter.

4
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.500
Standing heavy punch starts the follow-up on the crumpling Ryu.

5
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.400
Perfect light Flash Knuckle launches Ryu at the wall.

6
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.150
Jumping medium punch catches Ryu in the air.

7
00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:06.950
The delayed short-held air light Knuckle continues the juggle.

8
00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:09.000
Light Rising Uppercut finishes the corner conversion.
